because in some cases you can avoid them. For example, in the 3-flap discus=
sed in <a href=3D"https://www.hayastl.com/2026/06/08/erm-01-introduction.ht=
ml#lakes-rivers-and-lands">Lakes, Rivers, and Lands</a>, there is a vertex =
with a 540=C2=B0 angle (90=C2=B0 front and back =C3=97 3 flaps), but no waf=
fle walls are needed<sup id=3D"fnref:waffle-2" role=3D"doc-noteref"><a href=
