To understand how overlapping rivers work, let=E2=80=99s think back to the =
ideal model discussed in <a href=3D"https://www.hayastl.com/2026/06/08/erm-=
01-introduction.html#lakes-rivers-and-lands">Lakes, Rivers, and Lands</a>, =
